msgid "Optional. Format: ABCDE1234F"
msgstr "वैकल्पिक। फ़ॉर्मेट: ABCDE1234F"

#: accounts/forms.py:264
msgid "PNG, JPG or WEBP, up to 2 MB."
msgstr "PNG, JPG या WEBP, 2 MB तक।"

#: accounts/forms.py:265
msgid "Optional, e.g. sharmarice@okicici. Printed with a QR on invoices."
msgstr "वैकल्पिक, जैसे sharmarice@okicici. चालान पर QR के साथ छपता है।"

#: accounts/forms.py:266
msgid "2-6 capital letters or digits, e.g. SRT gives SRT-20260927-0001."
msgstr "2-6 बड़े अक्षर या अंक, जैसे SRT से SRT-20260927-0001 बनेगा।"

#: accounts/forms.py:267
msgid "For example: Goods once sold will not be taken back."
msgstr "उदाहरण: बिका हुआ माल वापस नहीं लिया जाएगा।"

#: accounts/forms.py:268
msgid "Used to suggest a selling price from your cost."
